::Make HVPC, charge the big grid at CC. Facility below has emergency EXIT, should lead close to Ctech stash, or something else entirely.

Need cables, core and controller. Cables in the sewers. Core and controller in Upper Metro. Last two need Orange box. Play them sounds at emergency buzzers.

Heat up grid, then if needed heat up boilers down below.::&lt;end&gt;

